.claude/box.json
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
.omc/
# Experiments: an allow-list. A run must stay reproducible AND its measurements
# must survive, because a benchmark is stochastic — re-running never reproduces
# a past number (R21 re-measured four rows at runs=7 and all four moved).
#
# TRACKED, per run (~100 KB):
#   engine-capture.log  the serve command actually executed, INCLUDING -o
#                       overrides, plus the engine's prefix-cache hit rate and
#                       scheduler Running/Waiting lines. Nothing else records
#                       these. Not present in ~/.cache/sparkrun either.
#   state.yaml          probe args, pinned image digest, framework version,
#                       crash count, session timestamps
#   recipe-*.yaml       the candidate recipe, where a variant used one
#   round-tmp.json      every individual run value, so medians/σ recompute
#   telemetry*.log      clocks/temp/power — how R23 ruled out a thermal cause
#   clocks-*.txt        per-run clock snapshots
#
# IGNORED, deliberately:
#   consolidated.json   byte-identical duplicate of round-tmp.json
#   round-tmp.csv       the same numbers in another encoding
#   round-tmp.yaml      largest category, and it stores the recipe's CURRENT
#                       defaults — for pre-fold runs it states a value the run
#                       did not use (R23 arm1 ran at 8192; this file says 65536)
#   runs/               adds only version/timestamp/latency_mode/latency_ms/
#                       prefix_caching_enabled; throughputs already in round-tmp.json
#   *stdout*.log        sparkrun console output, no unique evidence
#
# Git cannot re-include a file inside an excluded directory, so each level is
# un-excluded before the level below it is excluded again.
research/*/experiments/*
!research/*/experiments/*/
research/*/experiments/*/*
!research/*/experiments/*/HYPOTHESIS.md
!research/*/experiments/*/EXPERIMENT.md
!research/*/experiments/*/*/
research/*/experiments/*/*/*
!research/*/experiments/*/*/engine-capture.log
!research/*/experiments/*/*/engine-serve.log
!research/*/experiments/*/*/state.yaml
!research/*/experiments/*/*/recipe-*.yaml
!research/*/experiments/*/*/round-tmp.json
!research/*/experiments/*/*/telemetry*.log
!research/*/experiments/*/*/clocks-*.txt
!research/*/experiments/*/*/PROVENANCE.md
!research/_template/experiments/.gitkeep
research/milestones/
research/*/QUEUE.md
